PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785147504
OL,3,CHoax threat made against plane bound
OL,4,Cfor Manchester Airport
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy is assisting police
OL,7,Fwith enquiries after a hoax threat was
OL,8,Fmade against an aircraft travelling to
OL,9,FManchester Airport.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Police said
OL,12,Fofficers were called at around 6pm on
OL,13,FFriday 24 July after the National Air
OL,14,FTraffic Services (NATS) reported a
OL,15,Fthreat relating to a flight heading to
OL,16,FManchester.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
