OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785147504
OL,3,CHoax threat made against plane bound
OL,4,Cfor Manchester Airport
OL,6,FWorking alongside the Royal Air Force
OL,7,Fand airport authorities, police
OL,8,Fdeployed resources to ensure the
OL,9,Fsafety of the aircraft and everyone on
OL,10,Fboard.
OL,12,FThe plane landed safely at Manchester
OL,13,FAirport and officers confirmed there
OL,14,Fwas no threat to passengers or crew.
OL,16,FFollowing enquiries, detectives
OL,17,Festablished that the report was a hoax.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785147504
OL,3,CHoax threat made against plane bound
OL,4,Cfor Manchester Airport
OL,6,FPolice have identified a 14-year-old
OL,7,Fboy from the Bolton area, who was not
OL,8,Fon board the flight, and said he is
OL,9,Fassisting officers with their
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,FChief Inspector Gary Homa, of
OL,13,FOperations at Manchester Airport,
OL,14,Fsaid: "This type of behaviour is
OL,15,Fcompletely unacceptable. The safety of
OL,16,Fthe public is always our top priority
OL,17,Fand every report of this nature is
OL,18,Ftreated extremely seriously.
OL,26,@vD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
