OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785147504
OL,3,CHoax threat made against plane bound
OL,4,Cfor Manchester Airport
OL,6,F"Hoax calls can cause significant
OL,7,Fdisruption, divert vital emergency
OL,8,Fservice resources and create
OL,9,Funnecessary concern for passengers,
OL,10,Fcrew and the wider public.
OL,12,F"Thankfully, this incident concluded
OL,13,Fsafely, but making false reports is
OL,14,Fnot a prank and can have serious
OL,15,Fconsequences. We will always
OL,16,Finvestigate incidents of this kind
OL,17,Fthoroughly and take robust action
OL,18,Fwhere offences have been committed."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUzD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
